        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "so that  $ \\mathbb{E}[\\Delta p_n \\mid \\Delta y_n > 0] > 0 $ whenever  $ \\lambda_n > 0 $. Since  $ \\lambda_n = \\frac{1}{2} \\sqrt{\\Sigma_{n-1} / \\sigma_u} $ is strictly positive in every round prior to full revelation, any positive innovation in signed order flow raises the price.",
