        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Proposition 4 (Price Impact Rises as Revelation Approaches). In the continuous-time limit of the sequential auction (Kyle (1985), Back (1992)), the price-impact coefficient  $ \\lambda(t) $ is time-varying. Under the standard parameterization",
            "block_bbox": [
                138,
                387,
                1084,
                461
