        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Price-impact regression.  $ \\Delta p_t = \\alpha + \\lambda \\cdot \\hat{y}_t + \\varepsilon_t $, where  $ \\hat{y}_t $ is the paper's signed-volume proxy (Method 2/3), should yield  $ \\hat{\\lambda} > 0 $ and be statistically significant.",
            "block_bbox": [
                162,
                671,
                1082,
                720
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 13,
            "group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    162.0,
                    671.0
                ],
                [
                    1082.0,
                    671.0
                ],
                [
                    1082.0,
                    720.0
                ],
                [
                    162.0,
                    720.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Signed flow should dominate unsigned/aggregate volume in short-horizon return prediction, consistent with the paper’s Method 1 vs. Method 2/3 comparison.",
            "block_bbox": [
                162,
                734,
                1082,
                783
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 14,
            "group_id": 13,
