                    162.0,
                    783.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Price impact and order-flow-based predictability should be stronger at higher trading frequencies / shorter rebalancing horizons (Proposition 4).",
            "block_bbox": [
                162,
                798,
                1083,
                848
            ],
