        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For each PERMNO and trading day in the CRSP Daily Stock File (DSF), we obtain the closing price (DlyPrc), share volume (DlyVol), daily return (DlyRet), shares outstanding (ShrOut), and the price and volume adjustment factors (DisFacPr, DisFacShr) needed to construct split-adjusted series. Where available, we also extract daily bid (DlyBid) and ask (DlyAsk) quotes for robustness checks against quoted-spread-based illiquidity measures.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                1163,
                1081,
                1280
